weave print_emit_c_help into void:
    calling spark.println with "Usage: psc emit-c <file> [options]"
    calling spark.println with "  --out=FILE              write bundle.c to FILE"
    calling spark.println with "  --stdout                write the bundle to stdout (default)"
    calling spark.println with "  --test                  emit the integrated test runner"
    calling spark.println with "  --library               emit no main wrapper"
    calling spark.println with "  --no-dce                disable dead-code elimination"
    calling spark.println with "  --prune-types           prune unused types/consts"
    calling spark.println with "  --dce-scope=user        also prune project weaves"
    calling spark.println with "  --prune-native          prune unused includes/links"
    calling spark.println with "  --no-line-markers       omit #line directives"
    calling spark.println with "  --strict-c99            portable C99 (no GNU extensions)"
    calling spark.println with "  --target-compiler=NAME  gcc|clang|tcc|msvc"
    calling spark.println with "  --target-os=OS          linux|macos|windows (default: host)"
    calling spark.println with "  --target-arch=ARCH      x64|arm64|x86|arm (default: host)"
    calling spark.println with "  --release-unsafe        disable bounds/overflow checks"
    calling spark.println with "  --debug                 debug profile"
    calling spark.println with "  --help"

## Ayuda de `lex`.
